# 强制 LF：Git for Windows 默认 autocrlf=true 会把 .sh/.py 检出成 CRLF，
# bash 脚本直接死于 '\r'、python shebang 同炸（2026-09-11 跨平台体检定案）
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf

# The release ZIP includes a byte-pinned upstream license in this notice.
/dsh-sidebar/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md text eol=lf

